WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.750
June 15th

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.790
Okay, 1:00 at my place tomorrow.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.460
Don't forget to bring the 
bowl and mixer, Nanako!

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.500
Bye-bye!

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.710
Later!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.460
Kotoba harari

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.630
Kimochi fuwari

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.540
Noseru omoitachi

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.130
Koi ni somatteku

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.330
Kimi to itara ame no naka 
mo chigatta shizuku ni naru

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.540
Donna moji o tsuzuttara

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:45.710
Iroasezuni nokoru no deshou?

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.250
Shitterun da

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:53.170
Ima no futari wa tooi ano hi ni naru koto

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:58.580
Sou desho kamisama

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:02.080
Marumaru mizu mo konai densha mo

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.710
Motto kono shunkan ga

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.710
Douka eien ni tsuzuite

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.750
Nante muri ka na?

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:20.000
Poem 6:  Nanako's Rebellious Phase

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.920
Oh man, he's adorable!

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.790
Isn't he?! His name's Rocco-chan!

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.790
I got a pet rabbit, myself.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.290
A rabbit?! Lemme see, lemme see!

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:31.880
This guy right here!

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:33.750
That's a pig...

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:35.880
Y-you're so mean, President!

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.790
S-sorry! I couldn't help it...

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.460
Wh-what's his name?

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:41.500
Agu!

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.710
Note: "Agu" is a breed of 
pig hailing from Okinawa.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.710
He IS a pig!

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.580
You taken a shine to little Agu?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.170
Well then, how 'bout you 
come over and meet him-

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:58.210
Oh, my God! Eiji finally brought a girl home!

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:01.790
We oughtta celebrate! 
Let's rustle up some grub!

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.170
Oh, by the way, little missy...
Mind tellin' me your measurements?

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.580
Uh, how 'bout I bring him 
to the park tomorrow?

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.710
Get up, Big Sis!

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:18.630
Don't you have plans today?

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:28.130
Maintaining a Relationship
With Your Teenage Daughter 
Recognizing Rebellion 1
She ignores you when you speak
Recognizing Rebellion 2
She stays holed up in her room

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.830
A rebellious phase, huh...

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.830
Thankfully, Nanako hasn't had one.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:33.210
"Recognizing Rebellion #1:
Your daughter ignores you when you speak to her."

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:39.250
Seems like this stuff doesn't
even apply to me and Nanako.

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.540
She always has the brightest smile
on her face when I talk to her.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:48.880
Just watch! Today will be no different.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.580
Oh! Morning, Nanako!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.460
How're you fee-

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:53.960
Not wearing
contacts

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.080
Wearing
earplugs

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.920
She ignored me AND she glared at me!

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.000
This can only mean...

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.210
she's rebelling...!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.750
I-I can't believe Nanako's going
through a rebellious phase...

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:17.040
Where...? Where did I go wrong...?

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:23.750
Was it that time I scolded 
her for being a picky eater?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:29.330
Come now, Nanako.
Milk tastes great once you get used to it!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.290
Or maybe it was the time I lit into her
for staying up late...?

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.130
You know, Nanako...

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.540
You'll get wrinkles if you stay up so late.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:51.630
Looking back on it now,
I guess I may have been a little too harsh...

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.380
Hold on! Don't get ahead 
of yourself, Yoshihiko!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.130
Th-this whole thing could just be
a big misunderstanding!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.920
Recognizing Rebellion 1
She ignores you when you speak

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.710
N-Nanako, you got a minute?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.380
Your ol' dad wants to talk 
to you about something.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.790
Nanako?! N-Nanako?!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.040
C'MON! JUST FOR A MINUTE! PLEASE COME ON OUT!

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:21.580
Okay! Your old man's gonna 
do something really cool!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.040
Here's my impression of a-

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.420
What are you doing?

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:27.290
If you're looking for Nanako,
she went out a little while ago...

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:33.540
H-hey, Honey?

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.500
The laundry you're doing right now...

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.880
Are you washing all our clothes together?

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:43.580
Huh? Well actually,
Nanako asked me to do hers separately.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.450
"My jersey's a mess!

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:51.000
S-separately? J-just hers... Separate...

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:47.590
You might want to do a load

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:49.300
Of my stuff alone!" she said.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.630
What's with the theatrics?

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.710
Recognizing Rebellion 3
Keeps her laundry separate from yours

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.670
Oh, God... I can't believe 
it... Anything but that!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.290
Yo!

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.130
I brought Agu like I promised!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.830
My little sister came, too.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.080
I'm Hanabi Busujima.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.500
Thanks for always looking out for my big bro!

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.130
She's always spoutin' off 
grown-up stuff like that.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.880
This is Nanako, she's a friend from class.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.960
Oh, you're Nanako!

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.080
My big bro talks about you ALL the time!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.630
I-I do not...!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.880
But you said the only two things you really,
really like are senryu and Nanako.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.540
Please stop talking!

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.040
Agu's eating poop...

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.290
Agu's eating poop.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.710
Agu's eating poop!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.460
Rabbits tend to eat poop, y'know.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.000
Make sure you clean up 
whatever he doesn't eat!

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.670
'Kay!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.160
Ei-chan, you're super

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:08.600
Knowledgeable when it comes

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.790
To rabbits, aren't you?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.790
Well, I been lookin' after the little guy
since I was a kid, after all.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.750
You know how they say pets 
resemble their owners?

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:21.380
It's true. Agu totally 
copies everything I do.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.790
No, I...

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:28.310
"Please tell me you don't

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.220
Eat your own poop like Agu...

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:29.880
You really don't, right?"

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.170
Of course I don't!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.290
Hey, Hiro-kun.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.290
Has Nanako mentioned anything 
weird to you lately?

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.130
Weird...?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.010
"What color would a

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.470
Chameleon turn if it

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.630
Looked in a mirror?"

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.790
She asked me that.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.790
Sorry, I guess I wasn't specific enough...

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.250
Have you heard anything about your old man?

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:54.080
About you...?

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:59.210
"He takes forever in the bathroom,"
and "His morning breath is awful," and stuff.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.250
That's what Mom says.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:04.630
Your mother...?!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.250
Okay, let's try this one more time...

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.960
Has Nanako said anything about me?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:19.000
Or, maybe not even about me.
Just anything in general?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.460
She told me about her trip to the amusement park
the other day with her thug friend...

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.630
THUG FRIEND?!

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:28.960
I think she mentioned wanting to stay out
a little later with him or something...

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.960
A LITTLE LATER?!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.290
At this rate, Nanako's gonna...!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.750
Nanako's gonna...

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.170
...turn into a troublemaker!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.630
C'mere, you bastard!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.270
Where do you think you're goin'?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.390
I'll smash your face in!

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:44.790
It would be pretty funny 
to see that though...

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.460
But...

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.130
this thug friend of hers...

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.460
Why in the world...?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.870
Nanako, you smell good!

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.960
Make sure you're not invading 
Nanako's personal space!

00:07:58.460 --> 00:08:00.670
Okay, you sit on her lap next, Big Bro!

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.130
Huh?!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.540
Wha-?!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.420
I'm not gonna sit on your lap,
so you don't have to do that!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.880
Oh, jeez! You have MORE poop in you, Agu?!

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.000
I'm all outta poop bags...!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.630
Hey, Nanako...

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:21.040
Are you my big bro's girlfriend?

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.100
You're STILL pooping?!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.750
How'd you reload so fast?!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:32.210
God, it's still comin' out! 
You're not even that big!

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:36.920
Whoa! I'm kinda impressed, 
but... So much poop!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.020
I'm not his girlfriend,

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:40.600
But it makes me happy that

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:41.750
It seemed like I was!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.830
So you're his mistress?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.580
Nanako, I think it's about 
time we call it a day.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.500
You got stuff to do after this, right?

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:53.590
'Kay then, see you at school tomorrow.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.310
Hey! Glad you could make it! Come on in.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:11.750
What's wrong, Dear?
It's your day off, but you seem depressed.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.420
H-Honey... I'm sorry about all this.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:19.500
The truth is... I think Nanako is going
through a rebellious phase.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.630
Well, she IS around that age...

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.580
And they say that rebelliousness is
a sign of overprotective parents.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.630
For the time being, why not 
try letting go of her a bit?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.040
"Letting go"?!

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.830
"Letting go"?!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:43.770
Um, are you alright, Dear?

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.460
Nanako is my most precious treasure!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:53.780
If she really wants to leave my side
and blossom into adulthood...!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.670
Then... In that case...!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:02.790
Yoshihiko Yukishiro, 45 years 
old. From this day forth...

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.250
...I'm cutting ties with Nanako!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.210
YUKISHIRO

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:16.630
Sounds like Nanako's home.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.290
I have nothing left to say to her anymore.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.940
Here you go, Papa!

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:25.210
I baked this cake just for you!

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:26.530
Go ahead, have some!

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.960
Wha-?!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.750
I-it's nothing. I-I'd love to have some.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.880
But, why...?

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.030
I wanted to say

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.590
Thanks for being a great dad.

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:45.710
I love you so much!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:54.960
It's delicious.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.540
Are Children Addicted to Smartphones?
New Battle for Sales on Father's Day
Many Fathers are Treating
Themselves This Father's Day

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.080
I guess I should've known.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:15.540
Waracchau kurai mattaku chigau watashitachi

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:20.920
Show window utsuru sugata sae

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:26.580
Taiyou mitai ni anata ga hohoemu to

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:35.130
Odayaka na kuuki ga nagareru

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:42.330
Arikitari na nichijou de sae mo

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:47.920
Anata to nara kagayakidasu

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.380
Tatoe nani ga okita toshitemo

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:54.540
Tamani kizutsuki kizutsuketemo

00:11:54.540 --> 00:12:01.880
Nanigenai hi o shinjiteite

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.500
On the next epi-

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.930
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:09.080
Nanako and the-

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.710
-Seven Wonders of the Rain!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.000
Next Time, Poem 7
"Nanako and the Seven Wonders of the Rain"
